        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            If you need to hear the household, buy the
            <strong class="text-white">Shokz OpenRun Pro 2</strong>, or the OpenRun to save money
            and gain a higher water rating. If you want to shut out a loud motor and know the buds
            will not move, buy the <strong class="text-white">Beats Powerbeats Pro 2</strong>, or
            the Soundcore Sport X20 for a fraction of the price. For a cheap pair that stays in,
